Depends: qml6-module-org-kde-kcmutils, qml6-module-org-kde-kirigami, qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-dialogs, qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, libkf6purpose-bin, systemsettings, ums (>= 15.9.0), ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: System Settings page for Universal Media Server
 Media Server (DLNA) under Multimedia in System Settings: switches the
 ums user service on and off, sets the server name and the shared folders
 (Pictures, Music and Videos by default), and opens UMS's web interface.
 It writes UMS's own configuration files. Includes renderer playback
 controls through MPRIS2 and Play on TV or headset actions for Dolphin
 and Purpose. The user's existing UMS sharing choices remain in charge.
